# `instanceof` nominal identity across SEPARATE packages: the consumer compares
# against the producer's imported vtable singleton (not a reconstructed shape),
# and a local subclass of an imported class chains its parent link to it.
# name           dir       deps                       root
@test/shapes     shapes    -
@test/rects      rects     @test/shapes
main             app       @test/shapes,@test/rects   root
